      "position": [
        -32,
        480
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Blog · Daily Signal Collector\nRuns every day at 07:00 UTC. Reads the Config tab, pulls free public feeds (Google Trends, NWS alerts, FEMA declarations, Brave searches for furnished-housing topics and the Furnished Finder blog, optionally Search Console), classifies and scores every item, and upserts it into the **Signals** tab keyed by signal_id. The Friday Synthesizer reads the last 7 days from that tab.\n\nSearch queries and keyword rules live in the Config tab — no workflow edit needed to tune them. Enable the Search Console node once a Google OAuth credential with webmasters.readonly exists.\n\nSee docs/BLOGGING.md and docs/blog-automation/PLAN.md in the site repo.",
        "width": 880,
        "height": 352
      }
    }
